<title>UK: HSBC upgraded in Panmure sector review.</title>
<headline>HSBC upgraded in Panmure sector review.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in HSBC Holdings were firmer on Monday, helped by a Panmure Gordon sector review after analysts at the brokerage upgraded the stock to a &quot;buy&quot;.</p>
<p>The shares were up 17-1/2p to 14.76 stg by 1456 GMT.</p>
<p>&quot;The bank sector has taken a bit of a caning in the last month or so,&quot; said David Poutney, industry analyst at Panmure Gordon.</p>
<p>&quot;It looks a bit overdone, people should now be looking to cautiously pick-up selected stocks,&quot; he added.</p>
</text>
